  "all_ingredients_flat": "riced cauliflower, grated potatoes, onion, mint, cilantro, green chillies, Chaat Masala, ground flaxseed, turmeric powder, red chili powder, Salt",
  "instructions": "BATTER: If using frozen grated potatoes and frozen riced cauliflower, microwave them for 5 minutes. Add all the ingredients and mix with hands to form a batter (make sure potatoes & cauliflower are not too hot).\nWAFFLES: Preheat the waffle maker as per instructions. Place a big lemon size ball of the mixture on waffle maker. Spread with a flat spoon and cook for 3-4 minutes.\nSERVE: Carefully remove waffles and serve them with sugar-free homemade tomato sauce or your favorite homemade chutneys & dressings.",
