    "air-fry"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Serve them with sugar-free homemade tomato sauce or your favorite homemade chutneys & dressings.",
  "notes": "TIP: For crispiness, we may air fry cooked waffles for 3-4 minutes.",
